WEBVTT

00:00:11.001 --> 00:00:12.503
Lucy?
露西？

00:00:12.586 --> 00:00:15.965
She got through... with a little help.
她逃出去了…还好有帮手

00:00:16.048 --> 00:00:19.009
- Thanks.
- Well, you were busy.
谢了
你当时正在忙

00:00:19.093 --> 00:00:23.764
I assume you won't let things
get that close again!
我想你不会
让危险情形再发生了

00:00:28.936 --> 00:00:32.022
You better get up there.
Just in case.
你最好上去那里 以防万一

00:00:32.106 --> 00:00:34.525
I don't expect the Telmarines
will keep their word.
我不期望坦摩人信守承诺

00:00:38.571 --> 00:00:39.864
- Ah!
- Sorry.
对不起
没关系

00:00:39.947 --> 00:00:41.824
It's all right.
对不起
没关系

00:00:41.907 --> 00:00:46.287
- Be careful.
- Keep smiling.
小心点

00:00:50.666 --> 00:00:52.793
(crowd yelling)

00:00:58.966 --> 00:01:00.968
How does he look to you?
你认为他看起来怎样？

00:01:01.510 --> 00:01:02.970
Young.
年轻力壮

00:01:05.681 --> 00:01:09.977
But His Majesty's doing
extremely well... for his age.
不过陛下的表现很好
以您的年纪来说

00:01:10.060 --> 00:01:11.645
(moans in pain)

00:01:18.402 --> 00:01:19.945
I think it's dislocated.
我的肩膀好像脱臼了

00:01:24.575 --> 00:01:27.995
What do you think happens
back home if you die here?
若死在这里 现实里会怎样？

00:01:32.541 --> 00:01:35.002
You know you've always been
there, and I never really...
你一直很支持我 而我却…

00:01:35.085 --> 00:01:37.338
Ah! (gasping)

00:01:38.255 --> 00:01:39.506
Save it for later.
以后再说吧

00:01:54.271 --> 00:01:57.274
(crowd cheering)

00:02:07.534 --> 00:02:09.286
(both yelling)

00:02:12.414 --> 00:02:13.791
Ah!

00:02:16.418 --> 00:02:17.544
Ah!

00:03:03.382 --> 00:03:05.676
(grunting)

00:03:25.446 --> 00:03:27.239
Ah!

00:03:28.782 --> 00:03:32.453
- Respite!
- (crowd yelling)
休息！

00:03:33.829 --> 00:03:35.914
Respite.
休息！

00:03:35.998 --> 00:03:38.375
Now's not the time for chivalry, Peter!
现在不是展现骑士风范的时候

00:03:38.459 --> 00:03:40.961
(man) Show no mercy!

00:04:00.981 --> 00:04:03.484
- (Edmund) Look out!
- (yelling)
小心！

00:04:07.571 --> 00:04:09.406
(gasping)

00:04:29.468 --> 00:04:31.845
What's the matter, boy?
怎么了 小鬼头？

00:04:33.013 --> 00:04:35.182
Too cowardly to take a life?
太胆小 不敢下手？

00:04:39.186 --> 00:04:41.313
It's not mine to take.
你的命不属于我

00:05:23.605 --> 00:05:26.150
Perhaps I was wrong.
也许我以前都错了

00:05:26.233 --> 00:05:31.738
Maybe you do have the makings
of a Telmarine king after all.
也许你的确
够格当坦摩人的国王

00:05:38.162 --> 00:05:39.371
(screaming)

00:05:45.294 --> 00:05:47.379
Not one like you.
我绝对不像你

00:05:56.680 --> 00:05:59.600
Keep your life.
留下你的命吧

00:05:59.683 --> 00:06:03.187
But I am giving the Narnians
back their kingdom.
不过我要奉还纳尼亚人的国家

00:06:18.410 --> 00:06:21.121
(crowd cheering)

00:06:34.259 --> 00:06:35.511
My king.
我的国王

00:06:38.931 --> 00:06:43.101
I'll deal with you when this is over.
等这一切结束我再跟你算帐

00:06:44.061 --> 00:06:46.939
- It is over.
- (groaning)
已经结束了

00:07:01.495 --> 00:07:05.749
Treachery!
They shot him!
背信忘义！
他们射杀了王

00:07:05.832 --> 00:07:08.210
They murdered our king!
他们谋杀了我们的国王

00:07:09.211 --> 00:07:11.046
Be ready!
准备作战

00:07:12.839 --> 00:07:14.007
Peter!
彼得

00:07:15.676 --> 00:07:17.344
(yelling)

00:07:20.639 --> 00:07:22.391
Go!
快去

00:07:29.565 --> 00:07:32.776
To arms, Telmar!
取武器 坦摩人

00:07:32.859 --> 00:07:34.611
To arms!
取武器

00:07:38.782 --> 00:07:39.783
Loose!
发射！

